---

<div class="max-w-360 mx-auto">
	<div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center">
		<div class="w-1/2 sm:w-1/3 lg:w-1/4 xl:w-1/5 min-w-0 box-border p-2.5">
			<div class="service-card h-full">
				<svg width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="stroke-[#395B7A] stroke-[1.6]"><rect x="5" y="5" width="10" height="15" rx="1"/><path d="M9 5V3h4v2"/><path d="M15 9h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v6a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-3 0"/><path d="M8 12h4"/></svg>
				<h3 class="service-card-title">Inyección de Gasolina</h3>
				<p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-[#2B2B2B]">Puesta a punto y reparación de sistemas de inyección de gasolina.</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="w-1/2 sm:w-1/3 lg:w-1/4 xl:w-1/5 min-w-0 box-border p-2.5">
			<div class="service-card h-full">
				<svg width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="stroke-[#395B7A] stroke-[1.6]"><path d="M12 2s6 7 6 11a6 6 0 1 1-12 0c0-4 6-11 6-11z"/></svg>
				<h3 class="service-card-title">Inyección Diesel</h3>
				<p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-[#2B2B2B]">Diagnóstico y reparación de inyección diésel de alta presión.</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="w-1/2 sm:w-1/3 lg:w-1/4 xl:w-1/5 min-w-0 box-border p-2.5">
			<div class="service-card h-full">
				<svg width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="stroke-[#395B7A] stroke-[1.6]"><path d="M13 2L4 14h6l-1 8 9-12h-6z"/></svg>
				<h3 class="service-card-title">Electricidad/Electrónica</h3>
				<p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-[#2B2B2B]">Diagnóstico y reparación de electricidad y electrónica del automóvil.</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="w-1/2 sm:w-1/3 lg:w-1/4 xl:w-1/5 min-w-0 box-border p-2.5">
			<div class="service-card h-full">
				<svg width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="stroke-[#395B7A] stroke-[1.6]"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M12 2v4M12 18v4M4.2 4.2l2.8 2.8M17 17l2.8 2.8M2 12h4M18 12h4M4.2 19.8l2.8-2.8M17 7l2.8-2.8"/></svg>
				<h3 class="service-card-title">Encendido</h3>
				<p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-[#2B2B2B]">Revisión y sustitución de bujías, bobinas y sistemas de encendido.</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="w-1/2 sm:w-1/3 lg:w-1/4 xl:w-1/5 min-w-0 box-border p-2.5">
			<div class="service-card h-full">
				<svg width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="stroke-[#395B7A] stroke-[1.6]"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M7 6c-2 2-3 4-3 6s1 4 3 6"/><path d="M17 6c2 2 3 4 3 6s-1 4-3 6"/><path d="M12 8v5"/><circle cx="12" cy="16" r="0.6" fill="#395B7A" stroke="none"/></svg>
				<h3 class="service-card-title">Frenos, ABS, ESP</h3>
				<p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-[#2B2B2B]">Revisión y sustitución de frenos, ABS y sistemas de estabilidad ESP.</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="w-1/2 sm:w-1/3 lg:w-1/4 xl:w-1/5 min-w-0 box-border p-2.5">
			<div class="service-card h-full">
				<svg width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="stroke-[#395B7A] stroke-[1.6]"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M19.4 15a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33 1.82l.06.06a2 2 0 1 1-2.83 2.83l-.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82-.33 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1 1.51V21a2 2 0 0 1-4 0v-.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 9 19.4a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82.33l-.06.06a2 2 0 1 1-2.83-2.83l.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33-1.82 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51-1H3a2 2 0 0 1 0-4h.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 4.6 9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33-1.82l-.06-.06a2 2 0 1 1 2.83-2.83l.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82.33H9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1-1.51V3a2 2 0 0 1 4 0v.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1 1.51 1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82-.33l.06-.06a2 2 0 1 1 2.83 2.83l-.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33 1.82V9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.51 1H21a2 2 0 0 1 0 4h-.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51 1z"/></svg>
				<h3 class="service-card-title">Mecánica de Mantenimiento</h3>
				<p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-[#2B2B2B]">Cambios de aceite, filtros y revisiones periódicas de mantenimiento.</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="w-1/2 sm:w-1/3 lg:w-1/4 xl:w-1/5 min-w-0 box-border p-2.5">
			<div class="service-card h-full">
				<svg width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="stroke-[#395B7A] stroke-[1.6]"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"/></svg>
				<h3 class="service-card-title">Mecánica de Motor</h3>
				<p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-[#2B2B2B]">Reparación de motor, embrague y transmisión con recambios de calidad.</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="w-1/2 sm:w-1/3 lg:w-1/4 xl:w-1/5 min-w-0 box-border p-2.5">
			<div class="service-card h-full">
				<svg width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="stroke-[#395B7A] stroke-[1.6]"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="1"/><path d="M8 4v16M12 4v16M16 4v16"/></svg>
				<h3 class="service-card-title">Sistemas de Refrigeración</h3>
				<p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-[#2B2B2B]">Revisión y reparación del circuito de refrigeración del motor.</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="w-1/2 sm:w-1/3 lg:w-1/4 xl:w-1/5 min-w-0 box-border p-2.5">
			<div class="service-card h-full">
				<svg width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="stroke-[#395B7A] stroke-[1.6]"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M12 4v3M12 17v3M4 12h3M17 12h3"/></svg>
				<h3 class="service-card-title">Neumáticos y Alineación</h3>
				<p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-[#2B2B2B]">Montaje, equilibrado y alineación de dirección.</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="w-1/2 sm:w-1/3 lg:w-1/4 xl:w-1/5 min-w-0 box-border p-2.5">
			<div class="service-card h-full">
				<svg width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="stroke-[#395B7A] stroke-[1.6]"><path d="M12 2v20M4.5 6.5l15 11M19.5 6.5l-15 11"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1.6" fill="#395B7A" stroke="none"/></svg>
				<h3 class="service-card-title">Aire Acondicionado</h3>
				<p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-[#2B2B2B]">Carga de gas y reparación de aire acondicionado.</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="w-1/2 sm:w-1/3 lg:w-1/4 xl:w-1/5 min-w-0 box-border p-2.5">
			<div class="service-card h-full">
				<svg width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="stroke-[#395B7A] stroke-[1.6]"><path d="M9 8V2"/><path d="M15 8V2"/><path d="M18 8v5a4 4 0 0 1-4 4h-4a4 4 0 0 1-4-4V8Z"/><path d="M12 17v5"/></svg>
				<h3 class="service-card-title">Vehículos Híbridos</h3>
				<p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-[#2B2B2B]">Mantenimiento y diagnóstico especializado de vehículos híbridos.</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="w-1/2 sm:w-1/3 lg:w-1/4 xl:w-1/5 min-w-0 box-border p-2.5">
			<div class="service-card h-full">
				<svg width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="stroke-[#395B7A] stroke-[1.6]"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="18" rx="1.5"/><rect x="8" y="2" width="8" height="4" rx="1"/><path d="M8.5 13.5l2 2 4.5-4.5"/></svg>
				<h3 class="service-card-title">Pre-ITV</h3>
				<p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-[#2B2B2B]">Revisión previa a la Inspección Técnica de Vehículos.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
